 *
 * Parameters:
 *  OSATaskRef                 oSArEF          [IN]    HISR Reference.
 *  UINT8                   *pRIORITY      [OUT]    Priority.
 *
 * Returns:
 *  OSA_STATUS  OSA Complition Code.
 *
 * Notes:
 *
 ***********************************************************************/


/***********************************************************************
 *
 * Name:        OSATaskYield
 *
 * Description: Allow other task to run.
 *
 * Parameters: None
 *
 * Returns:  None
 *
 * Notes:
 *
 ***********************************************************************/


/***********************************************************************
 *
