* Group       : GKI, Config
* Description : This configures what task is used for communicating between
*                   the target (GKI) and a host PC. This task will be the route
*                   through which logging signals will be sent to the host PC and
*                   the PC host will use to send signalling scripts to the GKI
*                   Test Task. It is also used to transport inter-task signals
*                   as used during a split system build (or some diagnostic
*                   signals e.g. KiDevCheckInd). This defaults to the
*                   EMMI LOW PRI TASK ID.
*******************************************************************************/




