* Type        : enumeration
* Description : This defines the GKI queue id's for use by the system software.
*                   This is how a GKI task's input queue is identified to the GKI.
*                   Internally this has to be translated to the OS specific
*                   queue/mailbox id. The numerical values exactly matches the
*                   equivalent TaskId value.
*******************************************************************************/
